## Structure

```
src/
├── main.py                          ← uvicorn entry point
├── app.py                            ← FastAPI app factory
├── config/settings.py                ← env loading
├── errors/app_error.py               ← error classes
├── shared/
│   ├── database/<orm>.py             ← ORM setup
│   ├── cache/redis_client.py         ← Redis client
│   ├── auth/auth_dependency.py       ← JWT auth dependency
│   └── health/health_router.py       ← health check
├── domain/<module>/
│   ├── <module>_entity.py            ← domain entity (pure Python)
│   └── <module>_repository_interface.py
├── application/<module>/
│   ├── create_<module>_use_case.py   ← command use case
│   ├── get_<module>_use_case.py      ← query use case
│   └── create_<module>_use_case_test.py
└── infrastructure/<module>/
    ├── <module>_repository.py        ← persistence adapter
    ├── <module>_controller.py        ← FastAPI router
    └── <module>_schema.py            ← Pydantic DTOs
```

Call direction: `infrastructure → application → domain`. Domain never imports
from infrastructure or application.

